5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I think we should look at the actual problems. Maybe... the incident logs and the time lost to copying records?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,"That's a bit dry, Daisuke! I want to see who's actually doing the work. I'll check the coordination group staffing and developer availability.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's be realistic. We always fail at the start. I'll look into network coverage at customer plants and in-house developer availability.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I am concerned about the financial sustainability. I will look into the capital budget and software allowance, and vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm excited to see what we can do! But we should learn from the past, right? I'll check the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts and the record of cross-unit standardization efforts.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,pass,Daisuke,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, you're so serious! But I guess we need a budget. I'm sticking with my choices.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, ""excitement"" doesn't build systems. I'm curious if anyone actually knows the site conditions this time.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,It is better to be cautious now than to face a deficit later.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Shunichi, don't be so grumpy! I bet we can find a way to make it work if we look at what happened before!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
